<Base title="I Will Bloom guided cancer support journal · €38" description="Discover the €38 I Will Bloom journal, its guided pages and thoughtful accompanying extras. For yourself or someone you love."><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(product)}/><section class="pageintro"><p class="eyebrow">For yourself, or someone you love</p><h1>The I Will Bloom Journal</h1><p>Gentle structure for the thoughts, feelings and ordinary moments that belong to you.</p></section><section class="section container split product-details"><figure class="product-photo"><img src="/assets/verified/journal-cover.webp" width="1080" height="1350" alt="I Will Bloom journal showing the actual cloud cover, gold lettering and white spiral binding" fetchpriority="high"/></figure><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">A little space to begin</p><h2>Support for your mind — not just your schedule.</h2><p>A5 hardback with a white spiral binding. Guided reflection and everyday practical pages, with room to use the journal in your own way.</p><p class="price">€38.00</p><a class="btn" href="/#shop">Preview your order →</a><p class="smallnote">EU delivery estimate €6 · UK €10 · rest of world €22 for one journal. No extra IVA is added in this preview; tax and delivery arrangements will be verified before checkout opens.</p></div></section><section class="container box-gallery"><p class="eyebrow">Thoughtful pieces, chosen with care</p><h2>Inside your Bloom box</h2><p>Alongside your journal: a bookmark, retractable pen, small colouring-pencil set, Bloom Markers, a thoughtful gift card and Load Lighteners.</p><div class="box-grid"><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bloom-box-open.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Your Bloom box"><img src="/assets/verified/bloom-box-open.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Your Bloom box: The journal and its accompanying pieces, packed together with care."/></a><figcaption><h3>Your Bloom box</h3><p>The journal and its accompanying pieces, packed together with care.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bloom-markers.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Bloom Markers"><img src="/assets/verified/bloom-markers.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Bloom Markers: Small reminders to pause, reflect and notice a moment that matters."/></a><figcaption><h3>Bloom Markers</h3><p>Small reminders to pause, reflect and notice a moment that matters.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bookmark.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: One page at a time"><img src="/assets/verified/bookmark.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="One page at a time: A handmade bookmark to keep your place, whenever you return."/></a><figcaption><h3>One page at a time</h3><p>A handmade bookmark to keep your place, whenever you return.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/load-lighteners.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Load Lighteners"><img src="/assets/verified/load-lighteners.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Load Lighteners: Practical suggestions to help you ask for the support you need."/></a><figcaption><h3>Load Lighteners</h3><p>Practical suggestions to help you ask for the support you need.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/colouring-pencils.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Colour & Calm"><img src="/assets/verified/colouring-pencils.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Colour & Calm: A small set of colouring pencils for a quiet moment with the pages."/></a><figcaption><h3>Colour & Calm</h3><p>A small set of colouring pencils for a quiet moment with the pages.</p></figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="prose"><h2>Inside the journal</h2><p>Daily pages make room for energy, hydration, how you feel and little moments worth remembering. Other sections include appointment-preparation prompts, Moments of Wonder, Unspoken Words and milestones.</p><p><a href="/the-purpose/">Explore the purpose and pages →</a></p><h2>A gift with space to be themselves</h2><p>A journal does not ask someone to explain their feelings or share what they write. Give it without a deadline or an expectation that it must be used every day.</p><p><a href="/bloom-library/a-gift-without-expectations/">Read about giving without expectations →</a></p><h2>Questions before choosing?</h2><p><a href="/contactiwb/">Contact Rachel</a> about the journal, gift enquiries or organisational purchases.</p></section></Base>